  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 17th level, as a standard action, the craven may attempt a disarm combat maneuver on a target within 30 feet. The target’s item must be worth at least 1,000 gp. If the combat maneuver check is successful, the target is disarmed and the item falls to the ground in the target’s square. For every 5 by which the check exceeds the CMD, the item lands 1 square closer to the craven. If this would place the item in the craven’s square, the craven may attempt to catch the item with a DC 10 Dexterity check; otherwise it lands in the craven’s square. The craven can only use this ability if he has at least one hand free. If the craven fails the combat maneuver check, the creature is not disarmed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/the-craven#toc38\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
